                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c0c85752-3c08-366c-b2ab-9bc6f22d6e96",
                        "entry_id": "5967dcb9-508a-36e7-8beb-72055723531d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "четырёхместная карета с открывающимся верхом"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "24266bbd-0d0e-4d0d-85a0-a93b0bcc0d95",
                                "sense_id": "c0c85752-3c08-366c-b2ab-9bc6f22d6e96",
                                "text": "Этот ландо нас задавит: в нём сидит щеголь и красавица, лошади, лакей, кучера ― всё в последнем вкусе. Вот и новая Москва, новейшие обычаи!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9dc44758-70ee-42fb-9cfb-a2195b081716",
                                "sense_id": "c0c85752-3c08-366c-b2ab-9bc6f22d6e96",
                                "text": "Разумеется, на самом видном месте красовалось раззолоченное ландо, в котором молодые только что возвратились из церкви."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "92fcd3e2-652a-4808-ae30-9034bf837a57",
                                "sense_id": "c0c85752-3c08-366c-b2ab-9bc6f22d6e96",
                                "text": "Это было длинное открытое ландо на дутых шинах с рессорами и мягкими кожаными сиденьями, сделанное из дорогого дерева с сохранившимися следами позолоты."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ef6c7220-bd35-3c27-87ed-f42687da2eb1",
                        "entry_id": "5967dcb9-508a-36e7-8beb-72055723531d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "легковой автомобиль, имеющий кузов с верхом, открывающимся над задними сиденьями"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0c5e5af6-b902-43ab-b809-ad0ef7bfd111",
                                "sense_id": "ef6c7220-bd35-3c27-87ed-f42687da2eb1",
                                "text": "К главному подъезду замка Пелегрин, описав решительный полукруг, прибыл автомобиль жемчужного цвета ― ландо."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "de1328c8-4bdd-3271-a4f2-ffd49cf94f97",
                        "entry_id": "5967dcb9-508a-36e7-8beb-72055723531d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "кузов такого автомобиля"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "80ceca8e-cfd3-4459-97b8-d671812afc18",
                        "source_entry_id": "5967dcb9-508a-36e7-8beb-72055723531d",
                        "target_lang_word": "landau",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "landau",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a381a7ca-40ad-37da-9a35-1dae730033d3",
                                        "entry_id": "2d62f98d-b2ae-3415-ad47-4a810265bbdf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A type of lightweight, four-wheeled carriage in which the front and back passenger seats face each other."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8ea87a0-ba3d-4b44-be39-53ce7210a85a",
                                                "sense_id": "a381a7ca-40ad-37da-9a35-1dae730033d3",
                                                "text": "Indeed, as the two gentlemen reached the door, a landau drove up, a magnificent yellow carriage, lined with brocade or satin of a faint cream colour, drawn by wonderful grey horses, with flaming ribbons, and harness blazing all over with crests: no less than three of these heraldic emblems surmounted the coats-of-arms on the panels, and these shields contained a prodigious number of quarterings, betokening the antiquity and splendour of the house of Clavering and Snell."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6929c979-aa3f-4456-9ddc-6ce6cd1d523d",
                                                "sense_id": "a381a7ca-40ad-37da-9a35-1dae730033d3",
                                                "text": "On an early winter afternoon, clear but not cold, when the vegetable world was a weird multitude of skeletons through whose ribs the sun shone freely, a gleaming landau came to a pause on the crest of a hill in Wessex."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70fd9c01-b673-49f1-9a85-424cde9de2a4",
                                                "sense_id": "a381a7ca-40ad-37da-9a35-1dae730033d3",
                                                "text": "Away they went, and I was just wondering whether I should not do well to follow them, when up the lane came a neat little landau, the coachman with his coat only half buttoned, and his tie under his ear, while all the tags of his harness were sticking out of the buckles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b5eecd02-fe41-32e6-9612-70d54d95d594",
                                        "entry_id": "2d62f98d-b2ae-3415-ad47-4a810265bbdf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A style of automobile based around the design of landau carriages."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9d17b475-d6fb-4f2c-a31a-f823b78c95e2",
